From 58706711399c0edf4a9b9dcfce087efcf7adccbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:02:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: make landing page responsive across phones, tablets and
 desktops

- Navbar: tap-to-open dropdowns for touch tablets, outside-click/Escape close,
  scrollable mobile drawer with real Product/Resources links, scroll lock,
  auto-close on resize, dropdowns capped to viewport width
- Hero: wrap badges, hide chart axis labels below md, smaller type on 320px
- Transactions: adaptive columns (drops Category/Account on small screens),
  names truncate instead of colliding with amounts
- Dashboard: remove 780px min-height on mobile, hide Weight column on phones,
  swipe hint for the Sankey chart
- Security: fluid heatmap grid (was ~420px wide), tighter padding on phones
- AI/Footer: responsive padding, breakpoints and safe-area insets
- Global: dvh units, viewport-fit=cover, scroll-padding for sticky header,
  reduced-motion support, no sticky hover on touch devices
